# Chip, Phase Technician

> Chip does not tank for your team in the normal sense. He is a portal with a health bar, and the health bar exists only so he can deliver the portal into the right position. His whole kit asks one question: can your team convert a teleport drop into a kill before the portal expires, and if the answer is no, the pick is wasted regardless of how well you play the hero?

