## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-08. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Conceal Pickoff Roam (Roam)

- Items: Tough Boots, Dominance Ice, Fleeting Time, Athena's Shield, Antique Cuirass, Immortality
- Core: Dominance Ice, Fleeting Time, Athena's Shield
- Emblem: Support Emblem with Agility, Pull Yourself Together, Focusing Mark
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Blessing: Conceal
- Flex: Radiant Armor over Athena's Shield when Use against sustained magic poke where Athena's one-rotation burst filter falls off.; Blade Armor over Antique Cuirass when Use when the enemy marksman is forced to auto-attack you during portal setup.; Oracle over Fleeting Time when Use when your team's sustain support needs amplified shields and you can sacrifice ult reset speed.
- Total cost: 11200 gold

Default ranked setup. Conceal lets you walk undetected into Shortcut range, and Support emblem with Pull Yourself Together keeps Flicker and equipment active skills cycling.

### Encourage Frontline Roam (Roam)

- Items: Tough Boots, Dominance Ice, Antique Cuirass, Radiant Armor, Guardian Helmet, Immortality
- Core: Dominance Ice, Antique Cuirass, Guardian Helmet
- Emblem: Tank Emblem with Vitality, Tenacity, Concussive Blast
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Blessing: Encourage
- Flex: Athena's Shield over Radiant Armor when Use against one-rotation magic burst rather than sustained magic damage.; Blade Armor over Guardian Helmet when Use when a basic-attack marksman is the primary threat and return damage matters more than regen.; Warrior Boots over Tough Boots when Use against full-physical drafts where CC reduction is less valuable than stacking physical defense.
- Total cost: 11380 gold

Frontline variant for teams that need Chip to soak damage and provide Encourage aura during grouped fights rather than setting up solo pickoffs.

### Purify Anti-CC Roam (Roam)

- Items: Tough Boots, Dominance Ice, Athena's Shield, Antique Cuirass, Oracle, Immortality
- Core: Dominance Ice, Athena's Shield, Oracle
- Emblem: Support Emblem with Agility, Pull Yourself Together, Focusing Mark
- Battle spell: Purify
- Blessing: Conceal
- Flex: Radiant Armor over Athena's Shield when Use against sustained magic poke that outlasts Athena's single burst-block window.; Blade Armor over Antique Cuirass when Use when the primary physical threat relies on basic attacks rather than skill damage.; Fleeting Time over Oracle when Use when CC is light enough that Purify is insurance rather than mandatory, and ult resets win more fights.
- Total cost: 11010 gold

Heavy CC counter build. Purify pre-cast gives 1.2 seconds of control immunity to get Shortcut off against Aurora, Tigreal, Ruby, and Khufra lock chains. Does not counter suppression from Franco or Kaja.

